>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Labas isulat: ['last index of ord = '] + (( txt huling-posisyon: ['ord'] ) - 0), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['index of ord = '] + (( txt hanapin: ['ord'] ) - 0), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['index of ad = '] + (( txt hanapin: ['ad'] ) - 0), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['last index of W = '] + (( txt huling-posisyon: ['W'] ) - 0), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['last index of d = '] + (( txt huling-posisyon: ['d'] ) - 0), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['txt equals Word Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Word Salad'] ), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['txt equals Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Ceasar Salad'] ), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), bagong-linya.

Programa linisin.

